{"PARTY_TASK_SCOUT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"{name}, could you check the building I've marked on your map? Tell us what's in there","Will you check that place for us? Tell us if it's worth going near","I don't like not knowing what's in that building - check it out and come back safe","Can you check that place for us? Just look, don't be brave, please just look","We need eyes on that building, you're quicker than us, go see what's in there","Somebody's got to go look, and my knees are shot, would you mind? Be careful, be so careful","Go peek in there for us, would you? If it looks bad, back out","I'd go myself but I'd be useless, you check it, come back and tell me","Would you scout it out? I'll sleep a little better knowing what's inside","Would you peek inside that place for us? Just peek, no heroics, then come tell us","Can you check if it's safe in there? I'll owe you a favor, a big one","Be our eyes, will you? Look around, count what's inside, then hustle back","There's something in there, I can feel it, go see what, and be quick","You're the stealthiest of us, go have a look, we'll cover you","Check it out for us, and if you see anything breathing, run","Take a quick walk through, tell me if it's worth the risk","Walk over there and look, and tell me if it's quiet","Take a peek around the place and tell me","I need eyes on that place, would you be my eyes?"}},
