{"PARTY_TASK_WATER","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"We're running low on water - bring us a couple of clean bottles when you find them","Could you find us some drinking water? Two bottles would help a lot","Water's short, anything clean you can bring back","We're almost out of clean water, could you find some? Anything, even a few bottles","Water, we need water, the kids haven't had a proper drink since morning, please","I hate to ask, but we're dry, any clean water you can bring would be a lifesaver","Throats are cracking over here, bring water, whatever you can carry","Our canteens are bone dry, could you find clean water? Please, as soon as you can","The kids are crying for a drink, anything you can find, bring it","We'll die of thirst before we die of anything else, find water","We have almost no water left, almost none, please find some","Please, bring water, any clean water, the kids are parched"}},
{"PARTY_TASK_WATER","reg=law,swat",{"We need clean water - find two bottles and bring them in","Water's low - pick up two bottles on your way","Get us some clean water - two bottles","We're short on water, bring what you can find, clean only","Water supply is low, get some, boiled or sealed, I don't care","Water supply is low, find some","We're out of water, go find some, anything clean","Water's low, find some"}},
{"PARTY_TASK_WATER","reg=military,elite",{"We're low on water, bring back two bottles","Need two bottles of clean water, go find some","We need water - bring two bottles","Water is low, resupply, sealed containers preferred","We need potable water, go find it","Resupply, water","Resupply water, priority one"}},
{"PARTY_TASK_WATER","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"We're dry - find two bottles of water and bring 'em here","Go find us water, two bottles, clean stuff","Water - two bottles - move","Go get us something to drink, anything wet, even beer","Find us a drink, anything wet","Find water, preferably the kind you don't have to boil"}},
