{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"That's a lot of them! {name}, get back here!","Oh, no, look at all of them - stay with us!","Too many! Move, move!","Oh God, oh God, a crowd, a BIG crowd, we've got to go, RUN, run!!","Too many!! There's too many of them, go, go, go!!","Holy hell, look at all of them, move, move, MOVE!!","We can't fight that, we can't, go, back up, quietly, quietly, GO!","Horde! HORDE! Everybody, away from here!","Shit, shit, shit, shit, there's hundreds, get out, get out!","Jesus, it's a whole herd of 'em, turn around, now","Horde, horde, horde, leave the bags, just go","We can't fight that, we can't hide from that, run!","Everyone, back off, now. We can't afford to get trapped","Holy mother of God, look at them all, look, look, LOOK","That's hundreds, that's hundreds, we can't, we CAN'T, move!","Nobody say a word. Hold still, let me get a look before we move"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=law,swat",{"Big group, {name}! Fall back with us!","Too many to fight - move!","That's a crowd - back off, now","Large group of infected, withdraw!","Horde!! HORDE!! Pull back!","Large group of infected, fall back, now, now, now!","Horde incoming, withdraw, we can't hold here","Too many, pull back!","Horde, withdraw","Massive group of infected, withdraw","Large infected group, withdraw, now"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=military,elite",{"A whole crowd of them! Fall back, {name}!","Too many! Pull back to me!","Too many of the dead. We need to leave","Mass infected, pull back!","Horde sighted, fall back, fall back!","Large contingent, withdraw to rally point","Mass infected, fall back, fall back","Horde, pull back, move","Horde, pull back","Large infected force, disengage","Horde, pull back, withdraw to the rally point"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison",{"Shit, that's a mob! Run!","Nope, nope - too many - go!","Get out of there, {name}!","Fuck me, fuck me, run!!","Holy hell, that's a mob, scatter!","Holy shit, look at 'em, scatter, scatter!","There's a whole damn mob coming, run!","Fuck this, that's too many, go go go!","Fuck, run!!","Fuck me, there's thousands, move, MOVE!"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh",{"OH GOD- OH GOD- THERE'S SO MANY- RUN!!","Run!! RUN!! RUN RUN RUN!!","Holy shit, there's hundreds, RUN!!","We're dead, we're dead, we're all dead!!","Go go go go go GO!!","Holy- holy- HOLY SHIT, look at them!!","HORDE!! HORDE!! RUN!! RUN RUN RUN!!","That's too many!! THAT'S TOO MANY!!","Oh no, oh no, oh no, so many, so many"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_HORDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned",{"Back up! Keep them in front of us!","Nope, nope, nope, nope, we're leaving, NOW!","Fall back, fall back, FALL BACK!","Too many, too many, too many, MOVE!","Shit, a horde, a whole goddamn horde!","Move, move, we can't fight that","Horde, fall back, now"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_ZOMBIES","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"{name}, some of them up ahead - get behind me","I see them - quiet now - slowly","Dead ones up there - don't make a sound","Look out!! Look out, there's some of them near, get down, get DOWN!","Shh, shh, quiet, they're close, I think they're close, oh God","Got dead ones close, shh, nobody make a sound","Careful, careful, I can see them, over there, not good","Heads up, we've got company, the bad kind","Oh shit, oh shit, okay, calm down, calm down, let's not get any closer","Look, look, to the left, they're shuffling this way","Quiet, quiet, I hear them, they're close","Heads up, we've got a couple of dead ones","Careful with every step, they'll hear the crunch","Shh, hold still, they might not have noticed us","There's one, no, two, no, three, move, move","Careful, up ahead, I see movement, slow, shuffling movement","Don't run, don't run, walk, walk, they're slow","Those things are nearby. Keep your eyes open","We've got a few, nothing we can't handle, quietly now"}},
{"PARTY_WARN_ZOMBIES","reg=law,swat",{"Dead ones ahead, {name} - stay with me","Movement ahead - hold up","One of the dead! Watch yourself!","Stay low, stay quiet, they're close","Watch out, weapons ready","Infected close, weapons up, eyes open","Dead ones, infected, get down and shut it","Heads up, we've got a few of them close","Infected ahead, stay calm","Infected in sight, form up","Dead ones, infected, left side, quiet"}},
